UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Springfield, Missouri, Ozark Mountain Steel has served Southwest Missouri for over 26 years as a third-generation family-owned business. The company sources its raw steel directly from American mills and operates as a steel processor, fabricator, and stocking distributor for the region''s construction market.

