UPDATE companies SET description='Based in North Chelmsford, Massachusetts, Plastic Design Industries (operating as PDI Duct) has been fabricating PVC and CPVC duct systems since 1976. The company began as Plastic Design Inc. and has spent nearly five decades specializing in thermoplastic fabrication for corrosive environments.

