UPDATE companies SET description='Pacific Transformer was founded in 1981 in Anaheim, California, by three softball teammates who each borrowed $1,300 from their parents to start building transformers in a garage. The company remains founder-owned and headquartered in Anaheim, where it operates a domestic production facility alongside international operations in Mexico, Thailand, and China.

The company designs and manufactures custom magnetic components — including transformers (1 VA to 1,000 kVA), toroidals, inductors, chokes, and complete power-solution assemblies — for applications ranging from signal-level toroids to 750 kVA padmount units. Thousands of proven catalog designs are available for immediate shipment, while custom parts are modeled before winding and prototyped in as little as 48 hours. To date, Pacific Transformer has shipped more than 45 million units.

Its customer base spans aerospace (Mars rovers, 400 Hz flight hardware), defense (nuclear submarines, shipboard systems qualified to MIL-PRF-27), medical (low-leakage isolation magnetics for diagnostic imaging), EV infrastructure (Tesla Superchargers), industrial automation, data centers, renewable energy, professional audio, and utilities. Clients include NASA, the Department of Defense, Tesla, General Motors, and Otis Worldwide, as well as startups and regional manufacturers ordering prototype to mid-volume runs.

Pacific Transformer differentiates itself by managing the entire ecosystem around magnetics: affordable world pricing backed by owned overseas facilities with a U.S. failover plant, free engineering design and rapid prototyping with no obligation, quality systems certified to ISO 9001 and AS9100D, deep expertise in agency approvals (UL, CSA, CE, ETL, TÜV), and turnarounds — quotes in 24 hours, prototypes in 48 hours — all supported by an engineering team that stays with the project from concept through production.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','AS9100D','ITAR','MIL-PRF-27','UL recognized','CSA recognized','ETL recognized']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom transformer design and manufacturing (1 VA \u2013 1,000 kVA)", "Toroidal winding (power, audio, medical, current sense)", "Inductor design (power, filter, gapped core, PFC)", "Choke design (common mode, differential mode, line reactors)", "Power solution assemblies (enclosed, harnessed, potted)", "Prototyping and computer modeling before winding", "Agency approval engineering (UL, CSA, CE, ETL, T\u00dcV)", "ITAR-compliant manufacturing", "MIL-PRF-27 qualified production", "AS9100D quality management"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Medical", "Industrial & Commercial", "Alternative Energy", "Audio", "Automotive", "Conveyance Systems", "Data Centers", "Power Quality & Measurement", "Utilities", "EV Charging", "Renewable Energy"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Quote within 1 business day; prototype within 2 business days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Affordable world pricing via owned facilities in Mexico, Thailand, and China with a U.S. failover plant", "Free custom design and prototype delivery within 48 hours, no obligation", "Quality systems certified to ISO 9001 and AS9100D, with UL/CSA/ETL recognition", "Expertise in agency approvals across UL, CSA, CE, ETL, and T\u00dcV", "Quote turnaround within 24 hours and prototype in hand within 48 hours"], "fact