UPDATE companies SET description='Palmetto Welding & Fabrication Services, LLC was founded in February 2019 by Amanda Koch and Michael Meyer in Summerville, South Carolina. The husband-and-wife team relocated from Wyoming and Texas in 2018, bringing Michael’s extensive welding background and Amanda’s administrative experience to launch a mobile welding operation that quickly grew into a full-service fabrication and erection company.

The shop specializes in structural and miscellaneous steel fabrication and erection, working with carbon steel, stainless steel, and aluminum. Capabilities include SMAW, GMAW, FCAW, and GTAW welding in all positions, a plasma burn table that cuts plate up to one inch thick, and production of items such as ladders, handrails, stairs, RTU frames, bollards, and canopies. In January 2020 the company moved into a 9,500-square-foot facility on two acres and employs 17 skilled workers, with plans to expand into a 30,000-square-foot building in early 2022.

Palmetto serves industries including oil and gas, marine, nuclear, automotive, and structural steel construction across the Southeast region. The company’s AISC certification for both fabrication and erection allows it to bid on projects with stringent quality requirements, and its licensed and insured status supports work for commercial and industrial clients.

The business was started after Michael identified a local need for skilled, affordable welding services for both production and mobile work. The founders emphasize adapting to client needs, with Michael’s certifications across all metals and positions and Amanda’s operational management forming the core of their competitive position.', certifications=ARRAY['AISC Certified (Fabrication and Erection)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural steel fabrication", "Structural steel erection", "Miscellaneous steel fabrication", "Miscellaneous steel erection/installation", "Aluminum fabrication and installation/erection", "Plasma burning (plate up to 1\" thick)", "Welding (SMAW, GMAW, FCAW, GTAW)", "Ladder fabrication", "Handrail/guardrail fabrication", "Stair fabrication", "RTU frame fabrication", "Bollard fabrication", "Embed fabrication", "Shelf angle fabrication", "Lintel fabrication", "Canopy/awning fabrication", "Platform fabrication", "Cupola fabrication"], "industries": ["Oil and gas", "Marine", "Nuclear", "Automotive", "Structural steel construction"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless steel", "Carbon steel"], "equipment": ["Plasma burn table (up to 1\" thick)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["AISC certified in fabrication and erection", "Plasma burn table for plate up to 1\" thick", "Licensed and insured with regional service capability", "Welding expertise across all metals and positions (SMAW, GMAW, FCAW, GTAW)", "Mobile welding background evolved into full fabrication and erection shop"], "facts_used": ["Founded February 2019 by Amanda Koch and Michael Meyer -> /about", "Headquarters in Summerville, South Carolina -> /about", "Acquired 9,500 sq ft facility on 2 acres in January 2020 -> /about", "Employs 17 skilled workers -> /about", "Plans to expand to 30,000 sq ft facility in Q1 2022 -> /about", "AISC certified in both fabrication and erection -> /about", "Plasma burn table cuts plate up to 1 inch thick -> /services", "Works with aluminum, stainless steel, and carbon steel -> /about", "Offers structural steel fabrication, erection, miscellaneous steel fabrication, aluminum fabrication -> /services", "Michael Meyer certified in SMAW, GMAW, FCAW, GTAW in all positions -> /about", "Serves oil and gas, marine, nuclear, automotive, and structural industries -> /about", "Licensed and insured with regional service capability -> /about", "Started as mobile welding company, evolved into full fabrication and erection -> /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Our company handles all types of structural and miscellaneous metal fabrication and repair including aluminum, stainless steel, and carbon steel.", "founded_year": "2019", "employee_count": "17", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='palmetto-welding-fabrication-services-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Panhandle Woodworks LLC operates from Navarre, Florida, where founder Rick began crafting custom furniture after discovering woodworking in his 30s. What started as building pieces for his own home grew into a business serving clients across the region.

The one-person workshop produces hand-built furniture and cabinetry, including gates, cabinet doors, bathroom vanities, bunk beds, shelving, and pet crates and kennels. Rick also handles installation for many projects, working from customer photos or designs to deliver finished pieces. The operation runs as a second job, with scheduling paced to accommodate realistic timelines.

Clients range from residential homeowners needing custom gates, cabinet refacing, or built-in furniture to small commercial accounts such as a hair salon that commissioned custom cabinets and styling stations. Testimonials highlight projects for families, pet owners, and a local business owner.

