UPDATE companies SET description='Pegasus Auto Racing Supplies operates from New Berlin, Wisconsin, where it has served the motorsports community since 1980.

In addition to stocking products from brands like Beta Tools, Turbosmart, Setrab, and Schroth, Pegasus offers custom hose assembly services and technical product support to help customers select the right components.

Its customer base spans auto racing teams, vintage racers, karting competitors, and Formula Ford participants. The company emphasizes partnerships with teams across all forms of motorsports, supplying everything from data acquisition gauges to fire suppression systems for professional and amateur racers alike.

Pegasus differentiates itself through its long-standing commitment to in-stock availability, competitive pricing, and rapid order fulfillment. The company''s stated mission is to be the most reliable supplier in the racing marketplace, a position reinforced by decades of continuous operation and a focus on getting product out the door quickly.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom hose assembly", "Product distribution", "Technical product support"], "industries": ["Auto racing", "Motorsports", "Karting", "Vintage racing", "Formula Ford"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 1980 -> /", "Headquarters New Berlin, Wisconsin -> db", "Distributor of auto racing supplies -> /", "Nearly 1,000 part numbers in stock -> /", "Custom hose assembly service -> /", "Carries brands Beta Tools, Turbosmart, Setrab, Schroth, etc. -> /", "Serves auto racing, vintage racing, karting, Formula Ford -> /", "Emphasizes in-stock availability, competitive pricing, rapid fulfillment -> / and description"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Your In-Stock Source since 1980", "founded_year": "1980", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='pegasus-auto-racing-supplies' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
