UPDATE companies SET description='Pivot International is headquartered in Lenexa, Kansas, within the Kansas City metropolitan area. Founded in 2016, the company has scaled from 30 to over 900 employees in less than a decade and added nine companies to its international portfolio since its founding. It operates globally with offices across North America, Europe, and Asia, including UK offices supporting the European market, a Taipei office handling Asian business development and worldwide supply chain and quality operations, and Manila locations managing manufacturing operations.

The firm provides end-to-end product development, design, engineering, and manufacturing services. Its multidisciplinary teams of over 100 engineers deliver industrial design, mechanical engineering, electrical engineering, optical design, embedded software development, and project management. Pivot maintains more than 300,000 square feet of scalable, FDA-registered manufacturing space across company-owned facilities in the United States, Mexico, Europe, China, and the Philippines, supported by global supply chain teams. Capabilities span prototyping, design for manufacturing, regulatory support, production transfer, assembly, testing, and full lifecycle support from early concept through high-volume production.

Pivot serves startups, established manufacturers, and global organizations in highly regulated and technically complex markets. Its customer base spans medical devices, industrial equipment, agriculture, construction, security, sports and entertainment, and emerging sectors such as drones and IoT. The company notes its technology has been incorporated into everyday touch-screen interfaces, biometric security products, wearable devices, wireless components, and motor control systems.

Pivot emphasizes a "Personalized Service. Global Reach." model, positioning itself as a single-source partner that integrates engineering, manufacturing, and supply chain decisions from the earliest stages. The company highlights its flexible engagement models, more than 50 years of collective product development experience, and company-owned global operations as key differentiators for reducing risk, shortening timelines, and ensuring manufacturability.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Engineering Consultation", "Product Design", "Mechanical Design", "Industrial Design", "Electrical Engineering", "Mechanical Engineering", "Optical Design", "Software Development", "Project Management", "Prototyping", "Product Validation", "Design for Manufacturing (DFM)", "Regulatory Support", "Global Sourcing", "Production Transfer", "Assembly", "Testing", "Production Scaling", "Redesign", "Cost Reduction", "Component Obsolescence Management", "Lifecycle Support", "Product Strategy & Discovery", "Global Supply Chain Management"], "industries": ["Medical", "Industrial", "Agriculture", "Sports & Entertainment", "Security", "Drones/UAV", "IoT", "Embedded Electronics", "Optics", "Motor Control", "Construction", "Biometric Security", "Wearable Technology", "Touchscreen Technology", "Wireless Components", "Building Operations"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single-source partner for design, development, engineering, and manufacturing", "Company-owned global manufacturing facilities in US, Mexico, Europe, China, Philippines", "300,000+ sq ft of scalable, FDA-registered manufacturing space", "100+ multi-disciplined engineers on staff", "ISO 9001:2015 and ISO 13485:2016 certified"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Lenexa, Kansas -> /about", "Founded in 2016 -> db", "Grown from 30 to over 900 employees in less than a decade -> /about", "Added nine companies to int