UPDATE companies SET description='Pivotal Brewing Company operates a craft brewery and taproom in Bristol, Rhode Island, housed in a historic mill building The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed, nor are its founders named in available sources.

The brewery produces a rotating lineup of craft beers that spans modern lagers, hazy IPAs, seasonal releases, and small-batch experimental brews. Production takes place on-site, with the taproom occupying more than 4,000 square feet of flexible space beneath 35- to 45-foot ceilings. Beyond brewing, the facility functions as an event venue offering semi-private areas for 20 to 120 guests and full buyouts for up to 450 people, complemented by weekly trivia nights and regular live-music performances.

The business serves craft-beer enthusiasts, private-event clients — including corporate gatherings, weddings, and birthday parties — and the broader Bristol community. The taproom is dog-friendly and operates Wednesday through Sunday with afternoon and evening hours.

Pivotal emphasizes quality-driven experimentation and a diverse portfolio as its core differentiators, describing its approach as “brewed with intent, served with purpose.” The historic mill setting, high-ceilinged industrial interior, and programming of live entertainment are positioned as key reasons customers return.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Craft beer production", "Small-batch experimental brewing", "Flagship beer production", "Seasonal beer production", "Taproom service", "Event venue rental", "Live music hosting", "Trivia night hosting"], "industries": ["Craft beer", "Hospitality", "Event services", "Food and beverage"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["One of the most diverse craft beer lineups in Rhode Island", "Historic mill taproom with 4,000+ sq ft and 35-45 ft ceilings", "Event space accommodating 20-450 guests", "Dog-friendly taproom", "Weekly trivia and live music programming"], "facts_used": ["Location: Bristol, RI -> db", "Address: 500 Wood St Building 111, Bristol, RI -> /", "Craft brewery & taproom description -> /", "Beer lineup: lagers, hazy IPAs, seasonal, small-batch experiments -> /", "Taproom size: 4,000+ sq ft, 35-45'' ceilings -> /", "Event capacity: semi-private 20-120, full buyout up to 450 -> /", "Hours: Wed-Thu 4-9pm, Fri 1-10pm, Sat 12-10pm, Sun 12-7pm -> /", "Phone:  -> /", "Dog-friendly taproom -> / (review)", "5-year anniversary event Nov 25 -> /", "Weekly trivia and live music schedule -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We have one of the most diverse craft beer lineups in Rhode Island \u2014 from crisp modern lagers and hop-forward hazy IPAs to seasonal releases and small-batch experiments. Everything we make is dialed in...", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'