UPDATE companies SET description='Precise Cable Inc was founded in 1988 by Billie Van Ark in Longmont, Colorado. The company began as a home-based business driven by Van Ark''s passion for providing fabrication solutions. Over three decades, it has grown from grassroots research into a global supplier of custom cable and wire harnessing products.

Today, Precise Cable operates a 15,000-square-foot facility near Denver and Boulder. The shop specializes in custom cable harnessing and precision electro-mechanical assemblies, offering both turnkey and contract manufacturing services. For projects requiring controlled environments, the company maintains ISO-certified clean rooms for fabrication.

The company serves a broad range of industries, including aerospace (flight and ground support), defense, government, commercial, medical, oil and gas, communications, instrumentation, agriculture, automotive, and test and measurement.

