UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Food Equipment LLC operates from Gilbert, Arizona, where it was founded on April 5, 2008, by Jason Hertel. The company is family-owned and operated, born from Hertel’s observation that many restaurants and delis were overpaying for subpar repair work. He set out to provide honest, high-quality service at reasonable rates, guided by the principle that the company succeeds only when its customers succeed.

The business specializes in repair and preventive maintenance for a wide range of commercial food-preparation and cooking equipment. Technicians service all makes and models of meat slicers, vegetable cutters, mixers, meat choppers, grinders, bread and bagel slicers, vegetable choppers, warmers, and Amana commercial microwaves. They also serve as the Arizona authorized service location for several equipment brands and are the designated home of the EZPRO 120 ventless deep fryer for restaurants and concessions. Work is performed both on-site via mobile service and in the company’s shop, with after-hours and weekend availability.

Precision Food Equipment serves the foodservice industry across Arizona and, through the EZPRO line, nationally. Its customer base includes multi-unit chains such as Arby’s, Wildflower Bread Company, Claim Jumper, and YC’s Mongolian Grill, along with numerous independent restaurants, delis, and concession operators. Customized preventive-maintenance plans address safety, staff training, food-waste reduction, production consistency, and downtime prevention.

The company differentiates itself by routing every service call directly to a factory-trained technician, promising same-day or next-day response, and backing all work with a satisfaction guarantee.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Slicer repair", "Food preparation equipment repair", "Cooking equipment repair", "Preventive maintenance planning", "Mobile on-site service", "In-shop repair service", "After-hours and weekend service", "Equipment safety training", "Food waste reduction consulting", "Production quality assurance", "Authorized brand service", "EZPRO 120 ventless deep fryer sales and service"], "industries": ["Foodservice", "Restaurant", "Deli", "Concessions", "Commercial kitchen"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["EZPRO 120 ventless deep fryer", "Amana Commercial Microwaves"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day or next-day service for repairs", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Factory-trained technicians answer service calls directly", "Same-day or next-day on-site response", "Mobile and in-shop repair options", "Customized preventive-maintenance plans", "Satisfaction guarantee on all work"], "facts_used": ["Founded April 5, 2008 by Jason Hertel -> /about", "Family-owned and operated -> /about", "Services all makes/models of slicers and food prep equipment -> /services", "Customers include Arby''s, Wildflower Bread Company, Claim Jumper, YC''s Mongolian Grill -> /", "Mobile and in-shop service -> /services", "Preventive maintenance plans -> /services", "Arizona Authorized Service Location for brands -> /services", "EZPRO 120 ventless deep fryer -> /services", "Factory trained technicians -> /about", "Same-day or next-day service -> /about", "After hours service available -> /", "Satisfaction guarantee -> /", "Headquarters Gilbert, Arizona -> db", "Website http://www.precisionfoodequipment.com/ -> db"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Specializing in slicer repair, Precisi