UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Steel, operating as Precision Steel Construction, is a locally owned and operated steel erection contractor headquartered in Fargo, North Dakota. The company serves the tri-state region of Minnesota, North Dakota, and South Dakota from its Minnesota base. No founding year or founders are disclosed in public materials.

